    "rp_form": "Scope-note bond form with an internal reflection: rotate the second spin of every cell by J = [0 1; -1 0]; then -h = (1-delta) sum_{C in (Sx, iSy, Sz) on the second spin of the left cell} C (x) Theta(C), Theta(X) = F conj(X) F with F the swap of the two spins of a cell, and o = (1+delta) J-rotated S1.S2 is real with Theta(o) = o. In the cell basis M/sqrt(2) (F = M M^T/2, columns |00>+|11>, |00>-|11>, |01>+|10>, i(|01>-|10>)) this is -h = sum C' (x) conj(C') with complex C' and real diagonal o. No common cell basis gives a swap-symmetric sum C (x) C. Exact checks: src/rp.jl."
